# will_buys_weapon_in_city — a fighting will has a use where there is nobody to fight
#
# Brawling wants a fight with somebody hostile, or else a weapon fit for a brawl. A city street holds
# nobody hostile — striking a passer-by was the old target, and the click refused it there (a witness,
# the watch), so the will idled in every town. Now its plan goes to the smith to buy: the second
# target, reached across the city (city id 1, from the Haymarket, to the forge).
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --grant-mm brawling --location-type city --location-id 1 --npc-static --start-area Haymarket --period morning

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60
advance 12 180

expect-state will "will brawling steps="
expect-state will "propose to buy"
expect-state will "aim=2/2"
expect-state will "buy a weapon fit for a brawl"
expect-no-state will "will brawling steps=none"
quit
